  "description": "Everything about the Vitus Dominer is dialled for aggressive downhill riding, extreme features and racing. For the big days when you need your game-head on. When tree trunks line the route like stormtroopers and steep, intimidating lines funnel you in.\n\nNo return. Breathe. Relax. Total commitment. Downhill is a state of mind. Time slows and the kinematics of your bike and body are in perfect harmony, absorbing the hits and flowing like mercury. Analysing each root, rock or ripple on the trail ahead like a super-computer. No time to think about the close-calls because the next obstacle is coming at you fast.\n\nThe Dominer is equipped with performance components ready to shrug off the biggest hits. RockShox handles the suspension duties with the Boxxer Select equipped with Charger RC damper, paired with a Super Deluxe Coil rear shock for a buttery smooth ride. Super powerful SRAM Guide RE brakes keep you in control when things get rowdy with 200mm rotors front and rear. The SRAM GX DH 7 speed drivetrain provides quick, reliable shifting when you need it most.\n\nRolling on Nukeproof's Horizon V2 wheelset that purrs down the trail with 102 points of engagement for instant acceleration when you need to put the power down, the all-powerful Dominer can tame the descent, enabling you to ride new and old trails with less sketch and more style.\n\nBuilt to handle the rowdiest terrain at high speed\n\nRockshox Boxxer Select & Super Deluxe R Coil suspension\n\nReliable SRAM GX DH 7 speed drivetrain\n\nSRAM Guide RE brakes with big 200mm rotors to keep you in control\n\nNukeproof Horizon V2 tubeless ready wheelset with tape applied\n\nConfidence inspiring Maxxis Assegai & Minion DHR II tyres",
